estion count:** the tool API says account data unlocks after \"both questions\", but the policy asks 3.\n- **Sympathy sentence:** the hardship sympathy sentence isn't dictated, so I wrote one: \"I am very sorry to hear that.\"\n- **\"Cannot answer\" sentence:** no general one exists. I used \"I am sorry, I could not record your promise.\" because the only related instruction is to say a failed promise couldn't be recorded.\n- **Card digits:** the documents don't say to name a card's last digits, so products are named by type only, e.g. \"credit card\"."}
