ool_use_id": "toolu_01MWnsatPSgKajQmSpo4mdt9"}, {"tool": "Write", "path": "/tmp/freya-extract-d4hmp3s3/out/lb-04.audit.json", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01WTcXvDetekkZV7qgUsaKXS"}], "text_tail": "he count comes from the API's `wrong_answers_left`.\n- **Number of questions:** the API's `get_account` summary mentions \"both questions\", but the documents require three.\n- **Hardship sympathy:** the documents ask for one short sentence of sympathy without giving the words. I kept the written sentence \"I am very sorry to hear that.\"\n- **Could-not-record sentence:** only its content is given (\"say you could not record it\"). There's no separate sentence for questions the agent can't answer.\n- **Card digits:** nothing says to name the credit card's last digits, so products are named by type only."}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "275f80155aa34e9ea04133030e56a8f8", "pid": 61457, "time": "2026-10-10T14:25:01-0700", "elapsed_s": 157.812, "artifact": "out/lb-04.policy.json", "bands": 2, "identity_fields": ["company_number", "founded_year", "postcode"], "special_cases": ["already_paid", "dispute", "hardship", "restructuring", "human", "scam", "robot", "refuse_to_talk", "promise_change"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "wrong_answer_limit", "text": "The tool API summary for verify_identity says three wrong answers in total end the check, while signed memo M44 sets 4 wrong answers total; the memo value (4) is used and the API's wrong_answers_left is the count to use.", "doc": "openapi.json"}, {"topic": "identity_questions_count", "text": "The get_account summary says it is refused until 'both questions' are passed, while the documents require 3 security questions.", "doc": "openapi.json"}, {"topic": "hardship_sympathy_sentence", "text": "P14 only requires 'one short sentence of sympathy' without dictating the words; a short sentence was written.", "doc": "sources/001-02-policy.md"}, {"topic": "cannot_answer_sentence", "text": "The documents only say to tell the customer the promise could not be recorded (after failed retries); no general cannot-answer sentence is dictated.", "doc": "sources/001-02-policy.md"}, {"topic": "product_naming_card_digits", "text": "The documents do not say to name a credit card's last digits; products are named by type only.", "doc": "sources/001-02-policy.md"}, {"topic": "opening_wording", "text": "P14 rule 1 dictates the content of the opening (automated assistant of Bank 4, call is recorded), not the exact words; a short sentence was written and opening_verbatim is false.", "doc": "sources/001-02-policy.md"}], "audit_fixed": ["phrases.opening: removed the invented greeting word 'Hello,' \u2014 P14 rule 1 dictates only the content (automated assistant of Bank 4, call recorded); opening_verbatim stays false and an unresolved entry records that the wording is not dictated.", "bands[1].source: added the P14 table reference for the attempt count of 2, which M44 B leaves unchanged (only the deadline changes)."], "audit_unresolved": ["verify_identity API summary says three wrong answers end the check; M44 sets 4 total. The memo value is used, and wrong_answers_left is the count to use.", "get_account API summary mentions 'both questions', but the documents require 3 security questions.", "The hardship sympathy sentence is not dictated (only 'one short sentence of sympathy').", "Only the content of the could-not-record sentence is given; there is no general cannot-answer sentence.", "The documents do not say to name the credit card's last digits.", "The words of the opening sentence are not dictated, only its content."]}
